		  	      BLS staff availability on October 24, 2025
			
Due to the lapse in appropriations, BLS press office staff will be available to answer questions about
September 2025 CPI data only until noon (ET) today, October 24, 2025. The press office can be reached at
PressOffice@bls.gov.

The Cost-of-Living Adjustment (COLA) for 2026 is announced by the Social Security Administration (SSA).
Visit www.ssa.gov for more information.
